'''Zomboe''' (カバタリアン ''Kabatarian'') is a [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] variant of [[Hippoe]] that appears in [[Zombie Outbreaks]] and [[Legend Stages]]. They were added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], they were added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

