==Enemy==
Zomboe attacks somewhat slowly with a sluggish movement speed, but deals fairly high damage at low range. They burrow 625 distance past [[Cat Units]], revive once with 50% HP after 12 seconds, and have a 30% chance to inflict [[Slow]] for 4 seconds. Not much of a problem alone, but can really hurt when used as a peon for enemies such as [[Zyclone]] or [[Le'noir]].

==Strategy==
Zomboe isn't a relevant adversary under most circumstances, as their range and speed are low enough for stronger generalists to deal with them easily. However, their revive, as with many other Zombies, can put other units in an inconvenient position where Zomboe proceeds to wreck havoc unless promptly slain by a [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer]] or slain immediately after reviving, as they only have one knockback. Their Slow can also cause them to gain ground if their frequent attacks force units to stagger.

