==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 15.1 Update|Version 15.1]], Zomboe's description was:
<pre>
Wandered through a poison bog one
gloomy night and later woke up dead.
(S)he doesn't seem to mind though.
Now we'll never know if it's a he or she.
</pre>
**"Now we'll never know if it's a he or she." was a reference to [[Hippoe]]'s pre-[[Version 14.7 Update|14.7]] description ("This dangerous hippo has confidence in its stamina and power. (s)he? has a multi attack skill. We don't know if it is a he or a she.")
*Zomboe's Japanese name, Kabatarian (カバタリアン), is a portmanteau of 河馬 ''kaba'' (hippo) and バタリアン ''Batarian'' (Batallion), the Japanese name of the movie [[wikipedia:The Return of the Living Dead|''The Return of the Living Dead'']].
**When Zomboe's maw expands, some dark purple gas can be seen coming out of its mouth, referencing the toxic gas that reanimates the zombies in the movie.

